  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "面板",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "aikv-nav"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "dashboard",
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "label": "cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(aikv_uptime_seconds{service_name=\"aikv\"}, cluster)",
        "definition": "label_values(aikv_uptime_seconds{service_name=\"aikv\"}, cluster)",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 1,
        "description": "逻辑 AiKV 集群 (OTel Resource cluster, 同值覆盖 6 节点). 分布式部署主维度; 单机多集群时不可仅用 host 区分."
      },
      {
        "name": "host",
        "label": "host",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(aikv_uptime_seconds{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\"}, host_name)",
        "definition": "label_values(aikv_uptime_seconds{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\"}, host_name)",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 1,
        "description": "worker 物理机 (OTel host.name). 先选 cluster 再选 host; 同机多集群时 host 单独不够.",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "192.168.1.112",
          "value": "192.168.1.112"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "node",
        "label": "node",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(aikv_uptime_seconds{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",host_name=~\"$host\"}, node_id)",
        "definition": "label_values(aikv_uptime_seconds{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",host_name=~\"$host\"}, node_id)",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 3,
        "description": "aikv 集群节点 id (AIKV_CLUSTER_NODE_ID, 通常 1..6). All = 当前 host 下多节点对比."
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "宿主机 (node-exporter)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Node CPU",
      "description": "**面板作用**\nworker 宿主机 CPU 使用率.\n\n**图示/阈值**\nCPU used = 1 - idle rate (全核平均).\n\n>70% 关注; >90% 危险 (参考 old 面板).\n\n**数据来源**\nworker 宿主机 node-exporter (:9100) → Prometheus scrape (`instance=$host:9100`)\n\n**PromQL**\n`1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{instance=~\"$host:9100\",mode=\"idle\"}[$__rate_interval]))`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "1 - avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{instance=~\"$host:9100\",mode=\"idle\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "CPU used",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Node memory",
      "description": "**面板作用**\nworker 内存使用率.\n\n**图示/阈值**\nmem used ratio = 1 - MemAvailable/MemTotal.\n\n>85% 关注 OOM 风险.\n\n**数据来源**\nworker 宿主机 node-exporter (:9100) → Prometheus scrape (`instance=$host:9100`)\n\n**PromQL**\n`(1 - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{instance=~\"$host:9100\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{instance=~\"$host:9100\"})`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(1 - (node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{instance=~\"$host:9100\"} / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes{instance=~\"$host:9100\"}))",
          "legendFormat": "mem used ratio",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disk I/O",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n宿主机磁盘读写吞吐.\n\n**图示/阈值**\nread / write = bytes/s.\n\n无面板级颜色阈值 (palette-classic).\n\n**数据来源**\nworker 宿主机 node-exporter (:9100) → Prometheus scrape (`instance=$host:9100`)\n\n**PromQL**\n`sum(rate(node_disk_read_bytes_total{instance=~\"$host:9100\"}[$__rate_interval]))`\n\n**调优**\nFlush/Compaction 高峰时 write 升高.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(node_disk_read_bytes_total{instance=~\"$host:9100\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "read",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(node_disk_written_bytes_total{instance=~\"$host:9100\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "write",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "容器 (cAdvisor)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Container memory working set",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n各 aikv 容器 working set 内存.\n\n**图示/阈值**\n每条曲线 = `aikv-N` (compose service).\n\n无面板级颜色阈值 (palette-classic).\n\n**数据来源**\nAlloy cAdvisor (:8088) → Prometheus scrape\n过滤: `container_label_app=aikv`, `container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~aikv-${node}`\n\n**PromQL**\n`sum by (container_label_com_docker_compose_service) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{host=~\"$host\",container_label_app=\"aikv\",container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"aikv-${node}\"})`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (container_label_com_docker_compose_service) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{host=~\"$host\",container_label_app=\"aikv\",container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"aikv-${node}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{container_label_com_docker_compose_service}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Container disk I/O",
      "description": "**面板作用**\n各 aikv 容器磁盘读写吞吐.\n\n**图示/阈值**\nread / write per `aikv-N`.\n\n无面板级颜色阈值 (palette-classic).\n\n**数据来源**\nAlloy cAdvisor (:8088) → Prometheus scrape\n过滤: `container_label_app=aikv`, `container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~aikv-${node}`\n\n**PromQL**\n`rate(container_fs_reads_bytes_total{host=~\"$host\",container_label_app=\"aikv\",container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"aikv-${node}\"}[$__rate_interval])`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (container_label_com_docker_compose_service) (rate(container_fs_reads_bytes_total{host=~\"$host\",container_label_app=\"aikv\",container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"aikv-${node}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "read {{container_label_com_docker_compose_service}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (container_label_com_docker_compose_service) (rate(container_fs_writes_bytes_total{host=~\"$host\",container_label_app=\"aikv\",container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"aikv-${node}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "write",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "进程 (OTLP)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory & CPU (aikv process)",
      "description": "**面板作用**\naikv 进程内存与 CPU (OTel semconv).\n\n**图示/阈值**\nmem = aikv_used_memory_bytes; cpu user/sys = process_cpu_time rate.\n\nCPU 为 cores 占比 (rate 值); 内存单位 bytes.\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb 进程 → OTLP gRPC (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prometheus remote write\nResource 标签: `service_name=aikv`, `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n\n**PromQL**\n`aikv_used_memory_bytes{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}`",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "aikv_used_memory_bytes{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\"}",
          "legendFormat": "mem node {{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(process_cpu_time_seconds_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\",cpu_mode=\"user\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "cpu user node {{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(process_cpu_time_seconds_total{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\",cpu_mode=\"system\"}[$__rate_interval])",
          "legendFormat": "cpu sys",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "OTLP vs 容器 (对照)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "process.memory.usage vs container RSS",
      "description": "**面板作用**\nOTLP 进程内存 vs cAdvisor RSS 交叉验证.\n\n**图示/阈值**\notlp = process_memory_usage(used); rss = container_memory_rss.\n\n口径差异正常; 长期大幅偏离查 label/cgroup.\n\n**数据来源**\naikv/aidb 进程 → OTLP gRPC (:4317) → OTel Collector → Prometheus remote write\nResource 标签: `service_name=aikv`, `cluster`, `host_name`, `node_id`\n对照: Alloy cAdvisor (:8088) → Prometheus scrape\n过滤: `container_label_app=aikv`, `container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~aikv-${node}`\n\n**PromQL**\n`process_memory_usage{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\",process_memory_state=\"used\"}`\n\n**调优**\nLoki 日志: `{host=\"$host\", container=\"aikv-$node\"}`.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "process_memory_usage{service_name=\"aikv\",cluster=~\"$cluster\",node_id=~\"$node\",host_name=~\"$host\",process_memory_state=\"used\"}",
          "legendFormat": "otlp {{host_name}}/{{node_id}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (container_label_com_docker_compose_service) (container_memory_rss{host=~\"$host\",container_label_app=\"aikv\",container_label_com_docker_compose_service=~\"aikv-${node}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "rss {{container_label_com_docker_compose_service}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "description": "**基础设施**: worker (node-exporter) + aikv 容器 (cAdvisor) + OTLP 进程指标.\n\n`node` N → 容器 `aikv-N`. 面板 **!** 统一模板. 契约见 `dashboards/README.md`."
}
